OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to demolish Sandbanks hotel
OL,4,Arejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to demolish a seaside hotel have
OL,7,Fbeen rejected, after a council said the
OL,8,Fdeveloper "failed to provide sufficient
OL,9,Finformation" about the works.
OL,11,FThe Haven Hotel, built in 1887 and
OL,12,Fexpanded in the 1920s, sits on the
OL,13,Fsouthern corner of Sandbanks, at the
OL,14,Fentrance to Poole Harbour in Dorset.
OL,16,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole
OL,17,FCouncil (BCP) said the application for
OL,18,Fprior approval by Planning Strategy Ltd
OL,19,Flacked key information on the
OL,20,Fdemolition process, site restoration
OL,21,Fand environmental impacts.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
